{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"1M7J7W9674MT31V"},{"$ref":"1M7J7W9674MT369"},{"$ref":"1M7JM4AJ6D0C06J"}],"opens":"A reference into any source, read where a type is asked, resolves in place to a value of that type, at a point, a head or now: a search bar's buffer read as a string, a git blob as text, a channel as a signal. Reference as a primitive was let go by the author (16/44): everything is holons, and type reads them; what stays open is whether the type, whatever holds the holons, or both do the reading, the session's lean both, a mismatch refused.","restsOn":[],"stands":"noted"},"id":"1M7J7W9674MT437","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000007"],"name":"Resolution where sources meet types","prev":"989daac4cbf4eba871871118f180936c33faa715b3f77baef90250230efe151b"}
